recommend keep-going Chorus r2 (the whole quorum travels as a format chorus-v1 Bron record, byte-for-byte round-trip, still verifying at threshold offline), then r3 across a Knot and r4 true to the bytes (app == awk over a real fixture, the distinct-node count and each member's recomputed order-head matching). A served chorus · per-account mint authority · breach renames (cairn-first) · deep debride · seed force-push stay the maintainer's hand.
